{"n": 1030, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "1030.webp", "text": "30 $1 510\n\n5171452 INSTALLING BOTH SIDE\nMEMBER COVER PANELS\n(M-SYSTEM VERSION 1!)\n\nPainting:\n\nSide member panels are supplied with a prime\ncoat and substructure paint coats, so that only\nthe final paint coat has to be sprayed on.\nProcedures: BMW Plastic Part Painting (see\nBMW Paint Brochure),\n\nBMW acrylic paint + 20 % BMW softface\nadditive.\n\nCaution!\n\nMaximum enamel baking temperature: 50° C\n(122° F).\n\nTaping:\n— Clean surfaces for taping to remove grease,\n\n— Install adhesive tape at room temperature.\nHeat parts being pasted to 40 ... 50° C\n(104 to 122° F) for sufficient adhesion\nand press on at least 5 to 10 seconds.\n\nPaint side member panels (refer to “Painting”’).\nPaste side member template (1) on side\nmember as shown and mark location of holes.\n\n51-765\n\n30 51 624\n\nPaste template (2) along whee! housing opening\n(reference edges, see arrows), mark location of\nholes, punch centers and drill 5:mm (0.197)\ndia, holes with a spiral drill,\n\nOpen up holes to 9 mm (0.354”) diameter with\na 12 mm (0.472\") dia. slicing drill.\n\nDeburr and coat edges of holes with zinc dust_\npaint.-\n\nTreat side member cavities with a body cavity\nsealing compound to neutralize any burrs from\ndrilling which might have fallen in.\n\nMount side member pane! temporarily.\nMark location of holes on rear wheel house\nOpening, punch centers and drill 5 mm\n(0.197”) dia. holes.\n\nTake off side member panel again.\nDeburr and coat edges of holes with zinc dust\npaint.\n\nImportant!\n\nPress side member panel against wheel house\nopening firmly when marking location of\nholes,", "words": [["30", 0.2011, 0.7401, 0.2118, 0.7493], ["$1", 0.2163, 0.7401, 0.2244, 0.7493], ["510", 0.229, 0.7401, 0.2437, 0.7493], ["5171452", 0.2634, 0.0676, 0.3131, 0.0796], ["INSTALLING", 0.3262, 0.0683, 0.3931, 0.0802], ["BOTH", 0.3972, 0.069, 0.4271, 0.0802], ["SIDE", 0.4306, 0.069, 0.4549, 0.0802], ["MEMBER", 0.3